    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jojon Wik</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the furious fists and flying kicks of <strong>Jojon Wik</strong>, a wild, over-the-top <strong> fighting game</strong> where corruption gets KO\u2019d \u2014 one spoiled brat at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the pampered son of a corrupt official <strong>steals Jojon\u2019s beloved cat</strong>, he unleashes a storm of righteous vengeance the city will never forget. You are <strong>Jojon Wik</strong>, underground legend, and the last person you\u2019d want to anger. What started as a simple catnapping turns into a full-blown beatdown tour through the twisted world of privilege and power. Jojon Wik its not the official game of John Wick Movie.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade-style 3D Fighting</strong> \u2013 Tight controls, and flashy combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Story Mode</strong> \u2013 Satirical campaign filled with difficult boss, shady office.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Enemies</strong> \u2013 Bunch of bodyguards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Moves &amp; Costumes</strong> \u2013 Fight in style and absurd special attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice-acted Dialogues</strong> \u2013 With <i> serious</i> delivery.</p></li></ul>",
